# prevent-damage-on-turn at turn 1: "At the beginning of your upkeep, if it's your first turn, prevent all damage that would
# be dealt to you this turn." On turn 1 both of Bot1's own Lightning Bolts at itself are prevented - all of it, 6 damage in
# all, not a shield of the first 3 (CR 615.1a) - while its Bolt at Bot2 is dealt: the damage prevented is the wearer's
# alone. The effect lasts the turn only (CR 615.3), so Bot2's Bolt on turn 2 and Bot1's on turn 3 are dealt.

